hread of Items!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items from different time periods which synergize depending on their position and connections. Many items grant others stack bonuses which can be chained for massive power. Your foes scale exponentially, so you must rely on increasingly absurd combos to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/extras/74296f319b316c99a794f60b801736f6.poster.avif?t=1773130866\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/extras/74296f319b316c99a794f60b801736f6.webm?t=1773130866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/extras/74296f319b316c99a794f60b801736f6.mp4?t=1773130866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle Through Time!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Time Rogues and save the past, present and future from total destruction...</p>","developers":["Zoey Turner"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018720/5ee1f1d84a35d69686d1d4b2e316f7f10c9ee8b1/header.jpg?t=1773130866","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3018720/971379597/61d080e7a265dba18683fcbaef8f3d364045f062/1765286482/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765287272","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3018720/971379597/61d080e7a265dba18683fcbaef8f3d364045f062/1765286482/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765287272","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3018720/971379597/61d080e